# ============ ADMIN CREDENTIALS ============
# NOTE: These should be created manually in Supabase Auth & Profiles table
# DO NOT commit real credentials to version control!
#
# Default Admin Account (create manually in Supabase):
# Email: admin@example.com
# Password: (set a strong password in Supabase Auth)
# Role: admin
# Status: active
#
# To create an admin user:
# 1. Go to Supabase Dashboard → Authentication → Users
# 2. Click "Create new user"
# 3. Enter email and set password
# 4. Create the user
# 5. Go to "profiles" table and set role='admin' and status='active'
#
# Alternatively, use the Admin Users panel in the app to provision new admins
